    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000sa2c](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000sa2c) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Feb 19 2026 83km NE of Buol. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 1.3709 longitude 122.1572. It impacted 52140 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
